","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":36732928,"digest":"sha256:5a38bac7518bd9b344cb7e500cf02b3b4fc3821c48ea1403af113c9100e3b22c","download_count":60,"created_at":"2026-09-30T09:49:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T09:49:03Z"},{"id":600631121,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jzOdR","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":41456625,"digest":"sha256:6445a0e667b93e970a1c9d63ede3aba73e495cacf920f334955b734a90fc6862","download_count":77,"created_at":"2026-09-30T10:22:23Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T10:22:25Z"},{"id":600654258,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4jzUGy","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":12865,"digest":"sha256:ff79af3f152e49dea616e812365fcc5a6e6af9154dc2574526ec70c2695d2334","download_count":13109,"created_at":"2026-09-30T10:33:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-30T10:33:05Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n\n- DB2 支持表数据导入与数据传输，并可在传输预览中查看字段血缘\n- 数据网格支持将 SQL INSERT 语句直接粘贴到空白新增行批量录入\n- 值转换预览支持渲染 HTML 内容 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#10689](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10689))\n- 插件工作台界面可直接运行清单声明的命令\n- 数据网格新增可配置快捷键，快速聚焦 WHERE 筛选条件输入框\n\n### 改进\n\n- 大值单元格预览按分段限额加载并显示实际执行的 SQL，超大字段不再拖慢界面\n\n### 修复\n\n- Linux Secret Service 密钥查询修复，凭据加密在 Linux 桌面环境恢复正常\n- 无主键 PostgreSQL 表传输改按 ctid 块窗口分页，大数据量不再失败 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10743](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10743))\n- 迁移过程保留凭据错误详情并可从失败状态恢复 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#10731](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10731))\n- 外部驱动会话失败后正确关闭，不再残留占用\n- SunDB 内置 JDBC 驱动，开箱即用 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#10734](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10734))\n- MCP 访问策略仅在显式应用时持久化，不再自动保存\n- 连接导入文件支持 UTF-8 以外编码 (contributed by @JoAdo07) (PR [#10688](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10688))\n- 拖拽文件与文件夹到插件工作台改为流式传输 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10717](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10717))\n- CSV/TSV 导出不再用等号前缀公式包装日期 (contributed by @ma123456mai) (PR [#10729](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10729))\n- CSV/TSV 导出中和公式注入风险 (contributed by @jinpy666) (PR [#10542](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/10542))\n- MongoDB 无时区筛选日期按本地时间读取\n- 数据比较按表限量读取并标记截断，超大表不再无休止对比\n- 传输确认对话框按打开顺序堆叠，修复冻结\n- 网格工具栏浮层菜单锚定到触发按钮，不再漂移\n- PolarDB 快照事务语法兼容重试\n- 断开连接后侧边栏图标保留颜色标识\n- AI 支持将编辑器选中文本作为绑定上下文发送\n- 外观设置偏好正确持久化\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.29) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.29` 拉取。\n","mentions_count":6}
